" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,286][1080,2043]" drawing-order="7" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,286][1080,2043]" drawing-order="1" hint=""><node index="20" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,286][1032,63]" drawing-order="21" hint="" /><node index="22" text="“고객명”은 속성이고 “가람”은 속성값입니다. “고객”은 엔터티이며 “고객 C01”은 인스턴스입니다. 다만 논리 모델의 엔터티와 물리 테이블은 분석 관점과 구현 관점이 달라 항상 1:1이라고 단정하지 않습니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[93,286][987,18]" drawing-order="23" hint="" /><node index="23" text="관계형 모델은 행을 저장 순서로 식별하지 않습니다. 화면 맨 위에 있는 고객을 “첫 번째 고객”이라는 이유로 고정해서 참조하면 안 됩니다. SQL 결과의 순서를 보장하려면 뒤에서 배울 ORDER BY가 필요합니다. SQL의 조회 결과는 중복 행을 포함할 수 있다는 점도 수학적 집합과 구분합니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,286][1032,687]" drawing-order="24" hint="" /><node index="24" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,723][1032,1095]" drawing-order="25" hint="" /><node index="25" text="핵심 정리" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[93,768][987,852]" drawing-order="26" hint="" /><node index="26" text="전체는 엔터티, 한 건은 인스턴스, 항목은 속성, 실제 내용은 속성값입니다." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[93,882][987,1050]" drawing-order="27" hint="" /><node index="27" text="" resource-id="lesson-toc" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="이 장의 목차&#10;데이터베이스, 표에서 출발하기" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,1131][1032,1335]" drawing-order="28" hint=""><node index="0" text="이 장의 목차&#10;데이터베이스, 표에서 출발하기" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,1161][942,1302]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.sqldpass.app.adsqa" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false